# BSDE UPward 10 📱💻
**Mobile Code Editor by Elyas, Age 10**

An offline code editor built with pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.  
Created so you can code anywhere, even without internet and using just your phone.

### ✨ Features
- **Live Preview** - See your code render instantly in the iframe as you type
- **3-in-1 Editor** - Separate panels for HTML, CSS, and JavaScript
- **Mobile Responsive** - Built with `vh` and `vw` units. Works on phone and tablet
- **Download Project** - Save your entire code as
